        "answer": {
          "short": {
            "format": "maths-editor-document-v1",
            "version": 1,
            "blocks": [
              {
                "id": "p133-q73-b-short-result",
                "type": "paragraph",
                "fontSize": null,
                "align": "left",
                "spaceBefore": 0,
                "spaceAfter": 2,
                "lineHeight": 1.4,
                "indent": 0,
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "type": "math",
                    "latex": "a_k=0",
                    "display": false
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": " for every odd index ",
                    "marks": []
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "math",
                    "latex": "1\\le k\\le n",
                    "display": false
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": ".",
                    "marks": []
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "id": "p133-q73-b-short-method",
                "type": "paragraph",
                "fontSize": null,
                "align": "left",
                "spaceBefore": 0,
                "spaceAfter": 2,
                "lineHeight": 1.4,
                "indent": 0,
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "Compare coefficients of odd powers in ",
                    "marks": []
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "math",
                    "latex": "P(-x)=P(x)",
                    "display": false
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": ".",
                    "marks": []
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}P(-x)&=a_0+a_1(-x)+a_2(-x)^2+\\cdots+a_n(-x)^n\\\\P(-x)&=a_0-a_1x+a_2x^2-\\cdots+(-1)^n a_nx^n.\\end{align*}$$\n\nSince $P$ is even, for every real $x$,\n\n$$\\begin{align*}P(-x)&=P(x).\\end{align*}$$\n\nComparing coefficients of $x^k$ for each odd index $k$ with $1\\le k\\le n$ gives\n\n$$\\begin{align*}-a_k&=a_k\\\\2a_k&=0\\\\a_k&=0.\\end{align*}$$\n\nThus every odd-power coefficient is zero.",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 76
      }
